#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:5
msgid "Terminal block"
msgstr "端子排"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:7
msgid ""
"Element which represents a terminal block, connection between two cables "
"from the same potential."
msgstr "代表一个终端区块的元素连接两个电缆从同样的潜力。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:12
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Terminal block"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 终端区块"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:14
msgid ""
"For terminal block element exist two type of variables, the general "
"variables that are common for all type of elements and managed internally by"
" QElectroTech, and the specific variables for this type of element."
msgstr "对于端子排元素，存在两种类型的变量，即所有类型元素常见并由QEelectroTech内部管理的一般变量，以及这类元素的具体变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:18
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining variable values from this type of element at "
"the **Selection properties** panel. QElectroTech does not allow defining new"
" variables. QElectroTech allows only displaying variables at dynamic texts "
"and define value of the specific variables."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许在 **选择属性** "
"面板上定义该类元素的变量值。QEctroTech不允许定义新的变量。QEctroTech只允许在动态文本中显示变量，并定义特定变量的值。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:24
msgid ""
"If the Selection properties panel is not displayed, it can be displayed from"
" **Settings > Display > Selection properties**."
msgstr "如果选择属性面板未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:26
msgid "General variables"
msgstr "一般变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:28
msgid "**% {F}**: Label from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {F}**:从可找到元素的圆柱处划出标签"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:29
msgid "**% {f}**: Number from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {f}**:可以找到元素的光圈中的数字"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:30
msgid ""
"**% {M}**: Plant variable from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {M}**:可以找到元素的圆柱形的植物变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:31
msgid ""
"**% {LM}**: Location variable of the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {LM}**:可以找到元素的光圈位置变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:32
msgid ""
"**% {l}**: Folio line number from the workspace where the element can be "
"found"
msgstr "**% {l}**:可以找到元素的工作空间的Folio行号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:33
msgid ""
"**% {c}**: Folio column number from the workspace where the element can be "
"found"
msgstr "**% {c}**:可以找到元素的工作空间的Folio列号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:34
msgid "**% {id}**: Folio position in the project (Schema number)"
msgstr "**% {id}**:项目中的Folio位置(计划编号)"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:36
msgid "Specific variables"
msgstr "具体变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Label formula**: Definition of the formula which defines the **Label** "
"value. If a auto numbering pattern is selected during terminal creation, "
"QElectroTech defines ``%autnum`` as default formula."
msgstr ""
"**标签公式**:定义定义 **标签** 值的公式。如果在终端创建过程中选择了自动编号模式，QEelectroTech将 ``%autnum`` "
"定义为默认公式。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Label**: Internal variable which is used to defines the element code."
msgstr "**标签**:用于定义元素代码的内部变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/terminal_block.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Annotation**: Internal variable, it cannot be a formula (group of other "
"variables)."
